lox add lockmq: one broker, applied at once (Ctrl-C before the review: nothing is kept)

Management URL (required) [http://host.docker.internal:55672]: 
User (optional: - = the console asks for it at start with the password) [orders]: 
Vhost (optional: - = all vhosts the user can see) [orders]: -
AMQP URL, such as amqp://<mgmt host>:5672 (optional: - = no stream reads) [amqp://host.docker.internal:55673]: 
Production? (each approval needs the profile name typed) [y/N] 
Credentials: ask (typed, masked, at the console's start) or vault (required) [ask]: 
Name (required) [mq]: 
